r pending work finishes. Field becomes empty, coordinator reports searching=0, sidebar remains `sidebar.casks.all`, but the table still contains only mockvscode, not the full cask list. Expected: the destination's complete list returns after clear. Reproduced on the behavior-only original slice as well as the fix mock; original controller rendering logic is unchanged from main. `endSearchAndCleanup` at BPHomebrewViewController.m:843 reselects the already selected row without explicitly rebuilding the table. This is a likely explanation, not a separate implemented fix. Evidence: `refactor-clear-only-debugger.log` (searching=0), `refactor-clear-only-ax.txt`, `refactor-clear-only.png`; fix comparison `fix-cleared-ax.txt`. Actual inspection invoked existing controller methods through LLDB, not physical mouse typing. Root explicitly kept this separate from the pending-debounce task.\\n\\n**Original behavior-only extraction UI gate: APPROVED.** No actionable UI regression from that slice; eight applicable journeys passed and actual search surfaces checked in Aqua/Dark Aqua with stable accessibility identity and badges. The existing clear limitations are not claimed fixed.\\n\\n**Search-clear fix UI gate: NOT APPROVED until finding 1 is resolved.** Bounded visual inspection passed; this is a coverage finding, not an observed generation-guard failure. No extra eight-journey batch run on the fix once its source needed changes.\\n\\n## Source identities\\n\\nBase HEAD/main 826371682a2044ea9cf8a95fdc4ac63804737b09. No staged changes.\\n\\n- `.worktrees/issue-143-search`, refactor/search-coordinator, full SHA256 before/after `724a7568797d88086da992df60a5faecd36bc5fa6184d78dc1b79b6a4bfd7e6b`.\\n- `.worktrees/search-clear-cancellation`, fix/search-clear-cancellation, full SHA256 before/after `3770617bd4179ccb8dd50761b5cf9b33730589c5591dae1e1016a06becad8daa`.\\n- Hash input is binary `git diff HEAD` plus sorted untracked paths and exact bytes. The fix differs from original only by