{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T00:09:40.683Z","ordinal":20566,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a055ce-e4d9-77c1-ac18-0944a8c71200","turn_id":"01a07e3a-7088-74f3-8263-cbdd479f00a0","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-c0d831e8-446d-4dad-b787-e88c4deaf0f7","process_id":"26528","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","cat /private/tmp/cakebrew-142-verify.XZLvDL/handoff.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"cat /private/tmp/cakebrew-142-verify.XZLvDL/handoff.md","name":"handoff.md","path":"/private/tmp/cakebrew-142-verify.XZLvDL/handoff.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"# Issue 142 verification — PASS with documented environment retry\n\nVerified 2026-09-07 against frozen `.worktrees/issue-142-l10n` source hash `c39d734d72e5298ba5ea7d4a7a4f2ccb8812d48d285475e63ef6a430ab743064`, independently checked before and after. No repository edits. AGENTS.md and cakebrew-verify read completely. Prior independent UI gate approved in `/private/tmp/cakebrew-142-ui.Bwegyu/review.md`.\n\n## Gate evidence, executed in order\n\nAll Xcode commands used this worktree and `-derivedDataPath /private/tmp/cakebrew-142-verify.XZLvDL/DerivedData`, destination `platform=macOS`.\n\n| Step | Command / decisive evidence | Result |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Debug | `xcodebuild build -workspace Cakebrew.xcworkspace -scheme Cakebrew -configuration Debug CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO`; debug.log | PASS exit 0, 32.252s, no warning/error diagnostics |\n| Release | Same app build with `-configuration Release`; release.log | PASS exit 0, 16.881s, no warning/error diagnostics |\n| Full unit | `xcodebuild test -workspace Cakebrew.xcworkspace -scheme CakebrewTests CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO -resultBundlePath .../unit.xcresult`; unit.log | PASS exit 0, 436 tests, 7 explicitly opt-in real-brew compatibility skips, zero failures; suite9.354s/command13.622s |\n| UI compile | `xcodebuild build-for-testing -scheme CakebrewUITests` with documented ad-hoc settings; ui-compile.log line208 explicitly compiles CakebrewUITests.m | PASS exit0,6.167s, warning-free |\n| Full UI | `caffeinate -dimsu xcodebuild test -scheme CakebrewUITests` with documented ad-hoc settings and `-resultBundlePath .../ui.xcresult`; ui.log | Original run exit65:76 executed,75 passed,1 external-window interruption failure;1215.519s |\n| Authorized single retry | `caffeinate -dimsu xcodebuild test-without-building -scheme CakebrewUITests -only-testing:CakebrewUITests/CakebrewUITests/testOutdatedFormulaOffersUpdate` same unchanged artifacts, separate `ui-targeted-retry.xcresult` | PASS exit0, exact named test1/1,12.428s/command14.041s |\n\nAd-hoc settings: `CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY='-' CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Manual CODE_SIGNING_REQUIRED=NO CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=YES DEVELOPMENT_TEAM='' PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER=''`.\n\nThe complete suite and targeted retry together exercise all76 distinct journeys successfully; this is NOT a pristine76/76 full-suite run. No product failure remains demonstrated. Root explicitly authorized one retry only after decisive external-window evidence and fresh restoration/preflight. No further retry occurred.\n\n## External-window failure classification\n\n`testOutdatedFormulaOffersUpdate` clicked sidebar.formulae.outdated at t7.67s. At t7.87 XCUITest reported interrupting window from `com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92`, independently confirmed as installed Cursor's CFBundleIdentifier. XCTest entered its permission-dialog interruption monitor; snapshot queries retried at38.89s and69.90s, then timed out at115.76s. Reported source location CakebrewUITests.m:1334 is the sidebar click, before mockgit/update-button product assertions. Test failed117.877s. A one-second owned-runner stack sample is preserved as ui-interruption.sample.txt. The suite continued; all subsequent25 journeys passed. No CAKEBREW_UI_TREE dump was emitted because the timeout occurred before the later guarded application assertion; do not invent one. Original ui.log and ui.xcresult retained unchanged.\n\nDisplay remained unlocked. No unrelated app was clicked, terminated, or changed. The targeted retry performed the same sidebar click, found mockgit and asserted the Update Formula button, with no external-window interruption.\n\nUnit log includes nonfatal system `com.apple.linkd.autoShortcut` XPC registration noise, not compiler warnings or test assertion failures. UI logs include nonfatal IDELaunchParametersSnapshot debugger-version messages. Every named suite actually executed; startup timeout did not recur.\n\n## Additional slice-specific checks\n\n- `/usr/bin/ruby scripts/tests/localization-debt-tests.rb`:14 runs,216assertions,0failures/errors/skips,28.373858s.\n- `/usr/bin/ruby -w -c` reporter and tests:Syntax OK, no warnings.\n- `/usr/bin/plutil -lint Cakebrew/*.lproj/Localizable.strings`:all6 OK.\n- Real reporter `--summary .../report.md`:exit0 despite positive debt; cmp report.md/report.log exact. Outputs retained.\n- `git diff --check`:PASS; source hash unchanged.\n- Root separately reported `bash scripts/tests/action-runtime-tests.sh` PASS,3workflow checks/10references on same unchanged source; not independently rerun by verifier.\n\n## Shared-state cleanup\n\nExclusive runtime lease acquired only after UI reviewer released display/app/preferences/cache. Fresh state.swift snapshot immediately before full unit runtime; no stale prior backup used. After fullUI all owned apps/runners exited, original fresh persistent domain/cache restored and independently verified. Separate fresh retry-state snapshot taken before retry. After retry all owned apps/runners/xcodebuild/caffeinate exited; fresh retry preferences restored and fresh-process NSDictionary equality true, cache exact equality true. Cache SHA256 `01c1e93bc5bc2541d18a2d5711497c2290c13a0163d269d510bc2ae15a016df0`. Runtime/display lease released to root.\n\nNo host settings, installed app, real packages, or source files modified. Existing normal-startup UI journey exercises non-mutating real discovery; all package-operation journeys use mock fixtures. Independent expert review and delivery remain separate gates.\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"# Issue 142 verification — PASS with documented environment retry\n\nVerified 2026-09-07 against frozen `.worktrees/issue-142-l10n` source hash `c39d734d72e5298ba5ea7d4a7a4f2ccb8812d48d285475e63ef6a430ab743064`, independently checked before and after. No repository edits. AGENTS.md and cakebrew-verify read completely. Prior independent UI gate approved in `/private/tmp/cakebrew-142-ui.Bwegyu/review.md`.\n\n## Gate evidence, executed in order\n\nAll Xcode commands used this worktree and `-derivedDataPath /private/tmp/cakebrew-142-verify.XZLvDL/DerivedData`, destination `platform=macOS`.\n\n| Step | Command / decisive evidence | Result |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Debug | `xcodebuild build -workspace Cakebrew.xcworkspace -scheme Cakebrew -configuration Debug CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO`; debug.log | PASS exit 0, 32.252s, no warning/error diagnostics |\n| Release | Same app build with `-configuration Release`; release.log | PASS exit 0, 16.881s, no warning/error diagnostics |\n| Full unit | `xcodebuild test -workspace Cakebrew.xcworkspace -scheme CakebrewTests CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO -resultBundlePath .../unit.xcresult`; unit.log | PASS exit 0, 436 tests, 7 explicitly opt-in real-brew compatibility skips, zero failures; suite9.354s/command13.622s |\n| UI compile | `xcodebuild build-for-testing -scheme CakebrewUITests` with documented ad-hoc settings; ui-compile.log line208 explicitly compiles CakebrewUITests.m | PASS exit0,6.167s, warning-free |\n| Full UI | `caffeinate -dimsu xcodebuild test -scheme CakebrewUITests` with documented ad-hoc settings and `-resultBundlePath .../ui.xcresult`; ui.log | Original run exit65:76 executed,75 passed,1 external-window interruption failure;1215.519s |\n| Authorized single retry | `caffeinate -dimsu xcodebu