omplete suite and targeted retry together exercise all76 distinct journeys successfully; this is NOT a pristine76/76 full-suite run. No product failure remains demonstrated. Root explicitly authorized one retry only after decisive external-window evidence and fresh restoration/preflight. No further retry occurred.\n\n## External-window failure classification\n\n`testOutdatedFormulaOffersUpdate` clicked sidebar.formulae.outdated at t7.67s. At t7.87 XCUITest reported interrupting window from `com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92`, independently confirmed as installed Cursor's CFBundleIdentifier. XCTest entered its permission-dialog interruption monitor; snapshot queries retried at38.89s and69.90s, then timed out at115.76s. Reported source location CakebrewUITests.m:1334 is the sidebar click, before mockgit/update-button product assertions. Test failed117.877s. A one-second owned-runner stack sample is preserved as ui-interruption.sample.txt. The suite continued; all subsequent25 journeys passed. No CAKEBREW_UI_TREE dump was emitted because the timeout occurred before the later guarded application assertion; do not invent one. Original ui.log and ui.xcresult retained unchanged.\n\nDisplay remained unlocked. No unrelated app was clicked, terminated, or changed. The targeted retry performed the same sidebar click, found mockgit and asserted the Update Formula button, with no external-window interruption.\n\nUnit log includes nonfatal system `com.apple.linkd.autoShortcut` XPC registration noise, not compiler warnings or test assertion failures. UI logs include nonfatal IDELaunchParametersSnapshot debugger-version messages. Every named suite actually executed; startup timeout did not recur.\n\n## Additional slice-specific checks\n\n- `/usr/bin/ruby scripts/tests/localization-debt-tests.rb`:14 runs,216assertions,0failures/errors/skips,28.373858s.\n- `/usr/bin/ruby -w -c` reporter and tests:Syntax OK, no warnings.\n- `/usr/bin/plutil -lint Cakebrew/*.lproj/Localizable.strings`:all6