{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T00:12:46.033Z","ordinal":20683,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a07e5c-3051-72b1-ab1c-09b8807a31a7","call_id":"call_vgSBh8E8HVDaoS9dW4xNNWUM","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"9a0135\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000004255,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1878,\"output\":\"# Queued-clear UI regression journey implementation\\n\\nWorktree: /Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew/.worktrees/search-clear-cancellation\\nBranch: fix/search-clear-cancellation. Existing extraction and one-line cancellation fix preserved. Original issue-143-search and issue-142-l10n were not edited. No staging, commits, publication, or gate self-approval.\\n\\nRead AGENTS.md and cakebrew-implement completely. Assignment addresses only independent UI review finding 1 in /private/tmp/cakebrew-search-ui-resume.l7XhKE/review.md. The separate pre-existing completed-cask-search same-row stale table observation remains unfixed and out of scope.\\n\\n## Changes in this assignment\\n\\n- Cakebrew/Controllers/BPHomebrewViewController.m: add one DEBUG, explicit-mock-only menu action to the existing Notification Test menu. It sets the actual toolbar search field to mockvscode and invokes its real text-change delegate, then clears the field and invokes that same delegate within one main event. The actual path is BPToolbar controlTextDidChange -> submitSearch -> controller performSearchWithString -> coordinator scheduling/empty-string cleanup. No fake results, coordinator calls, sidebar logic or timing changes in the menu.\\n- CakebrewUITests/CakebrewUITests.m: add testClearingQueuedSearchKeepsInstalledFormulaeVisible. Begin at Installed Formulae with mockwget/mockgit and no mockvscode; click the native mock queue-then-clear menu; assert empty field, inverted one-second no-late-mockvscode expectation, Installed Formulae identity and expected installed rows retained, and final absence of mockvscode. This does not require keyboard focus or isHittable.\\n- Cakebrew/{en,de,fr,it,pt,zh-Hans}.lproj/Localizable.strings: one English placeholder key each for Search Then Clear Mock Search, following the repository policy. Existing duplicate translations belong to another isolated slice and were not changed here.\\n- Cakebrew/Controllers/BPSearchCoordinator.m was temporarily mutated for proof only; its final bytes exactly match the pre-assignment fixed source.\\n\\n## Build and observed mutation red -> green\\n\\nPrepared source and UI-target compilation while verifier owned shared runtime; no app/test/preferences/cache accesses during that period. Initial sandbox build failed in actool host-service access, not a source failure. Host build-for-testing succeeded in 26.568s with no warning/error diagnostics (build-for-testing-host.log). All six strings files passed plutil -lint. git diff --check passed.\\n\\nRoot then explicitly granted runtime. Display unlocked, no app/test processes present. Saved a fresh persistent-domain envelope and exact cache bytes immediately before launch using state.swift backup.\\n\\nMutation: remove only self.generation += 1 from endSearchReturningSidebarRow; leave cancelForNavigation guard intact. Command below builds current source and executes exactly one test:\\n\\n    caffeinate -dimsu xcodebuild test -scheme CakebrewUITests -destination 'platform=macOS' -derivedDataPath /private/tmp/cakebrew-clear-search-journey.4MOdKu/DerivedData -resultBundlePath /private/tmp/cakebrew-clear-search-journey.4MOdKu/red.xcresult -only-testing:CakebrewUITests/CakebrewUITests/testClearingQueuedSearchKeepsInstalledFormulaeVisible CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY='-' CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Manual CODE_SIGNING_REQUIRED=NO CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=YES DEVELOPMENT_TEAM='' PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER=''\\n\\nRED: red.log:730 confirms actual named test started; line786 fails the post-debounce expected mockwget row at test line1046; line789 test failed in17.449s; exit65. Empty field and Installed Formulae identity assertions passed. The inverted expectation itself did not trip, so it alone is not the mutation evidence. Saved XCTest screenshot red-before-teardown.jpeg visibly confirms the stale mockvscode result replaced the installed list while the field is empty and Installed Formulae remains selected. The final positive installed-row check caught that late accessibility state. This is the intended stale-callback regression, not a runner/setup failure. The screenshot was extracted from the existing result bundle without another app launch. It contains the full desktop and is private diagnostic evidence, not suitable for publication.\\n\\nRestore the exact generation line with apply_patch. Run the same command with green.xcresult and green.log. GREEN: green.log:761 named test passed in16.708s, one test zero failures, command21.063s exit0. No warning/error diagnostics. Nonfatal IDELaunchParametersSnapshot debugger-version messages were emitted in successful and failing runs; neither was a test initialization failure. No further refactor necessary. No source edits after green.\\n\\n## Final identity and workspace inspection\\n\\nWhole tracked and untracked workspace diff inspected, including inherited project/coordinator/test files. Index empty; git diff --check passes; no temporary mutation, debug probe, helper or evidence file entered the worktree.\\n\\nFinal full SHA256: 621fb48e01d4680b463be4076b5b6e0f6631a4cd0399c43c3829fb66fb46a2f6\\nAlgorithm: binary git diff HEAD bytes, followed by each sorted untracked path as newline + path + newline + exact bytes.\\n\\nChanged-in-this-assignment file hashes:\\n\\n    c0fe9b8940265423a26b14b3f47c85382be554d006c0b2a519cfc483aacce3d3  Cakebrew/Controllers/BPHomebrewViewController.m\\n    5b04b5bad9b9cdf88fa4f24b0f7a47a9fdee71de470985a42a05aeff2694e4ef  CakebrewUITests/CakebrewUITests.m\\n    6bfe80a277da9464a3c7bb01d1064f8b04