{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T00:14:10.184Z","ordinal":20752,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a07e5d-7908-7e11-830d-516e0ffb7a48","call_id":"call_WOlJ0nHJGnSfCFxeNXqjde69","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/clear_search_journey\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Implemented the missing queued-clear UI journey and mock-only menu action.\\n\\n- Mutation red: stale mockvscode replaced Installed Formulae; expected-row assertion failed.\\n- Restored green: journey passed, 16.708s, zero failures.\\n- UI target warning-free; six localization files lint clean.\\n- Preferences/cache restored exactly; runtime released; no commits.\\n\\n[Handoff with file inventory, hashes, and evidence](/private/tmp/cakebrew-clear-search-journey.4MOdKu/handoff.md)\\n\\nFinal full hash: `621fb48e01d4680b463be4076b5b6e0f6631a4cd0399c43c3829fb66fb46a2f6`.\\n\\nIndependent UI review and verification remain pending.\\n\\n\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/retry_test_session\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/search_ui_gates\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Clear-search fix UI gate approved. The new journey closes the coverage gap, and independent mock inspection confirms an empty field with installed rows intact and no stale result.\\n\\n[Review evidence](/private/tmp/cakebrew-clear-ui-rereview.D0LyDg/review.md)\\n\\nSource unchanged; fresh preferences/cache restored exactly; runtime released.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07e3a-7088-74f3-8263-cbdd479f00a0","create_time":1788826450.1848}}}
