{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T01:16:01.145Z","ordinal":21814,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a07e96-18f9-7571-a27b-3df2eb8f6baf","call_id":"call_TaqayhZwlXPrqrjnUF7bjFaD","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.8 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"2f8e3c\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.507049979,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1116,\"output\":\"# Search-clear fix final verification — PASS\\n\\n2026-09-07. Worktree `.worktrees/search-clear-cancellation`, full source hash before/after `621fb48e01d4680b463be4076b5b6e0f6631a4cd0399c43c3829fb66fb46a2f6`. Includes copied search refactor, generation invalidation fix, native mock menu adapter, all-six-locales string, and new queued-clear UI journey. No verifier source edits. AGENTS.md and cakebrew-verify read completely. Independent UI re-review approved exact hash in `/private/tmp/cakebrew-clear-ui-rereview.D0LyDg/review.md`.\\n\\nAll Xcode commands ran in this worktree with `-destination 'platform=macOS' -derivedDataPath /private/tmp/cakebrew-clear-final-verify.YTuRSJ/DerivedData`.\\n\\n| Gate | Command | Decisive evidence |\\n| --- | --- | --- |\\n| Debug | `xcodebuild build -workspace Cakebrew.xcworkspace -scheme Cakebrew -configuration Debug CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO` | debug.log; PASS exit 0, 13.716s, warning-free |\\n| Release | Same build with Release | release.log; PASS exit 0, 11.010s, warning-free |\\n| Full unit | `xcodebuild test -workspace Cakebrew.xcworkspace -scheme CakebrewTests CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO -resultBundlePath .../unit.xcresult` | unit.log; PASS exit 0, 444 tests, seven explicit opt-in real-brew compatibility skips, zero failures; 9.640s suite / 13.707s command |\\n| UI compilation | `xcodebuild build-for-testing -scheme CakebrewUITests` with documented ad-hoc settings | ui-compile.log; PASS exit 0, 3.877s, warning-free; CakebrewUITests.m actually compiled |\\n| Full UI | `caffeinate -dimsu xcodebuild test -scheme CakebrewUITests -resultBundlePath .../ui.xcresult` with ad-hoc settings | ui.log; PASS exit 0, 77/77 named journeys, zero failures or skips; 995.760s suite / 1029.233s command; no retries |\\n\\nAd-hoc settings: `CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY='-' CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Manual CODE_SIGNING_REQUIRED=NO CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=YES DEVELOPMENT_TEAM='' PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER=''`.\\n\\nInstrument validation: all intended named suites executed against this unique newly compiled target. All eight BPSearchCoordinatorTests passed inside the full unit suite, including retained-callback cancellation and a new query after clearing. New `testClearingQueuedSearchKeepsInstalledFormulaeVisible` started at ui.log:2144, invoked `Search Then Clear Mock Search` / `clearMockSearchBeforeDebounce:` at lines2176–2188 and passed at2205 in12.699s. The native action routes through actual toolbar delegate/controller/coordinator, then test checks empty field, original installed sidebar and mockwget/mockgit rows surviving beyond debounce, no mockvscode. Existing cask search/sidebar and all six notification leave-search/pending-search journeys also passed. No focused result was substituted for full coverage.\\n\\nAll six native Localizable.strings plutil lints passed. git diff --check clean; final full source hash unchanged. Build/unit/UI logs have no warning diagnostics. Nonfatal IDELaunchParametersSnapshot debugger-version/runtime system XPC messages did not prevent test execution; no new product assertion failure, signing failure, locked-display issue, or unrelated-window interruption occurred.\\n\\nState: before unit runtime, independently checked no competing Xcode/test/app processes and unlocked display, then took a fresh persistent-domain/cache snapshot specific to this exact run. No stale backup reused. After all UI app/runner processes exited, restored that fresh snapshot; independent new-process preference dictionary equality true and cache byte equality true. xcodebuild finalized