ace UI approval /private/tmp/cakebrew-142-ui.Bwegyu/review.md.\n\nThese are pre-commit code-review gate approvals for the exact hashes only. Delivery authorization, subsequent integrations, and CI merge gates remain separate responsibilities.\n\n## Final queued-search-clear fix: APPROVED\n\nWorktree: /Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew/.worktrees/search-clear-cancellation\nFull hash: 621fb48e01d4680b463be4076b5b6e0f6631a4cd0399c43c3829fb66fb46a2f6\n\nRead this worktree's complete AGENTS.md and code-review skill, full base-8263716 diff, empty staged diff, and all twelve changed/untracked files. This includes the previously reviewed coordinator extraction and project membership, one generation increment at the start of endSearchReturningSidebarRow, two retained-callback unit regressions, the DEBUG/explicit-mock-only native queue-and-clear menu action, its new UI journey, and one matching English localization key in all six locales. Independently recomputed exact source hash; git diff --check clean. No source or runtime changes by reviewer.\n\nTraced actual field delegate controlTextDidChange -> toolbar submitSearch -> controller performSearchWithString -> coordinator queue/clear -> existing timer main-queue callback. Clear advances generation before manager cancellation, suppressing retained pre-clear callbacks without suppressing a new post-clear query. Weak coordinator lifetime, existing navigation invalidation, manager publication cancellation, and controller-owned row validation/rendering remain coherent. Mock adapter only submits actual field changes in one main event; it does not replace state, results, or sidebar behavior. Existing DEBUG plus BPMockBrew/warm-target gates keep the new action out of ordinary/release UI. All selector/title entries match.\n\nRead fresh prerequisites: /private/tmp/cakebrew-clear-final-verify.YTuRSJ/handoff.md (warning-free Debug/Release/UI compilation, 444 unit tests with seven deliberate opt-in skips, pristine 77/