on, then six focused tests green. Full 442-test unit suite (seven opt-in skips) and all 76 UI journeys pass; Debug and Release are warning-free.' \u0026\u0026 git status --short \u0026\u0026 git rev-parse HEAD HEAD^{tree}\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew/.worktrees/issue-143-search\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"May I create the authorized reviewed search-refactor commit?\",\"max_output_tokens\":1800}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git -c commit.gpgsign=false commit -m 'ci(l10n): report translation debt without blocking valid changes' -m 'Expose per-locale confirmed placeholders, intentional English matches, and unreviewed matches in CI logs and summaries. Reject malformed inputs and stale metadata while keeping ordinary translation debt informational. Remove five later duplicate Formulae entries that shadow four existing translations.' -m 'Tests cover native decoding, duplicate detection, metadata validation, safe output, dynamic inventory partitions, valid additions and translations, and restored resource values. Observed regression reds before fixes; 16 reporter tests and 436 unit tests (seven opt-in skips) pass, as do all 76 UI journeys and warning-free Debug/Release builds.' \u0026\u0026 git status --short \u0026\u0026 git rev-parse HEAD HEAD^{tree}\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew/.worktrees/issue-142-l10n\",\"sandbox_permissions\":\"require_escalated\",\"justification\":\"May I create the authorized reviewed localization commit?\",\"max_output_tokens\":1800}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788830280.03092,"turn_id":"01a07e97-4be6-78d2-a501-3e8c618db8d6"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_Cl77vgD2K0CaIv2NWRKOh5zf","id":"ctco_01a07e98-7be9-77f1-b4e6-79d1e06edd4d","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788830317.545022,"turn_id":"01a07e97-4be6