rdered by impact, or explicitly approve the UI gate when no actionable findings remain. Route fixes to the implementer.\n\"\"\"\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":4602},"formatted_output":"name = \"cakebrew-ui-reviewer\"\ndescription = \"Independent Cakebrew AppKit UI and UX reviewer for visual changes, accessibility, platform conventions, and UI journey coverage.\"\nsandbox_mode = \"workspace-write\"\ndeveloper_instructions = \"\"\"\nRead AGENTS.md completely before acting; it is the sole authority for this repository.\nInvoke $cakebrew-ui-review. Review the implemented user-visible surface against the branch and workspace diff using the mock build and the repository's documented UI constraints.\nDo not edit source files. Return reproducible findings ordered by impact, or explicitly approve the UI gate when no actionable findings remain. Route fixes to the implementer.\n\"\"\"\n"},"started_at_ms":1788831779793,"completed_at_ms":1788831779793}}
