{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T01:45:14.423Z","ordinal":22238,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a055ce-e4d9-77c1-ac18-0944a8c71200","turn_id":"01a07ea9-3b2d-7200-b64b-ccfecb9fc7fb","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-859175b8-a355-48e5-8521-a8925b78ae7d","process_id":"18985","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '1,8p' /Users/scottdensmore/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md && git diff -- .codex/config.toml && git diff --name-only --cached && git status --short --branch"],"cwd":"file:///Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"sed -n '1,8p' /Users/scottdensmore/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md && git diff -- .codex/config.toml && git diff --name-only --cached && git status --short --branch"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"# Task Group: Cakebrew macOS product engineering, icon packaging, and GitHub backlog\n\nscope: Cakebrew’s native macOS/Homebrew product maintenance: layered app icons, evidence publication, deep codebase/backlog audits, and filing verified feature issues.\napplies_to: cwd=/Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew; reuse_rule=use Cakebrew paths, issue numbers, build command, and product constraints only in this checkout; reuse the verification and approval shields after checking the target repository and environment.\n\n## Task 1: Ship a layered macOS app icon and publish visual acceptance evidence\n\n### rollout_summary_files\ndiff --git a/.codex/config.toml b/.codex/config.toml\nindex 3d76ec0..b28a6e6 100644\n--- a/.codex/config.toml\n+++ b/.codex/config.toml\n@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@\n \n+sandbox_mode = \"workspace-write\"\n+approval_policy = \"never\"\n [features]\n hooks = true\n## docs/agent-workflow...origin/main\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-code-review/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-deliver/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-implement/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-plan/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-ui-review/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-verify/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-workflow/SKILL.md\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-code-reviewer.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-implementer.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-planner.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-ui-reviewer.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-verifier.toml\n M .codex/config.toml\n M AGENTS.md\n M CONTRIBUTING.md\n?? workflow.md\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"# Task Group: Cakebrew macOS product engineering, icon packaging, and GitHub backlog\n\nscope: Cakebrew’s native macOS/Homebrew product maintenance: layered app icons, evidence publication, deep codebase/backlog audits, and filing verified feature issues.\napplies_to: cwd=/Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew; reuse_rule=use Cakebrew paths, issue numbers, build command, and product constraints only in this checkout; reuse the verification and approval shields after checking the target repository and environment.\n\n## Task 1: Ship a layered macOS app icon and publish visual acceptance evidence\n\n### rollout_summary_files\ndiff --git a/.codex/config.toml b/.codex/config.toml\nindex 3d76ec0..b28a6e6 100644\n--- a/.codex/config.toml\n+++ b/.codex/config.toml\n@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@\n \n+sandbox_mode = \"workspace-write\"\n+approval_policy = \"never\"\n [features]\n hooks = true\n## docs/agent-workflow...origin/main\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-code-review/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-deliver/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-implement/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-plan/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-ui-review/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-verify/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-workflow/SKILL.md\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-code-reviewer.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-implementer.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-planner.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-ui-reviewer.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-verifier.toml\n M .codex/config.toml\n M AGENTS.md\n M CONTRIBUTING.md\n?? workflow.md\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":7035},"formatted_output":"# Task Group: Cakebrew macOS product engineering, icon packaging, and GitHub backlog\n\nscope: Cakebrew’s native macOS/Homebrew product maintenance: layered app icons, evidence publication, deep codebase/backlog audits, and filing verified feature issues.\napplies_to: cwd=/Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew; reuse_rule=use Cakebrew paths, issue numbers, build command, and product constraints only in this checkout; reuse the verification and approval shields after checking the target repository and environment.\n\n## Task 1: Ship a layered macOS app icon and publish visual acceptance evidence\n\n### rollout_summary_files\ndiff --git a/.codex/config.toml b/.codex/config.toml\nindex 3d76ec0..b28a6e6 100644\n--- a/.codex/config.toml\n+++ b/.codex/config.toml\n@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@\n \n+sandbox_mode = \"workspace-write\"\n+approval_policy = \"never\"\n [features]\n hooks = true\n## docs/agent-workflow...origin/main\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-code-review/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-deliver/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-implement/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-plan/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-ui-review/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-verify/SKILL.md\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-workflow/SKILL.md\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-code-reviewer.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-implementer.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-planner.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-ui-reviewer.toml\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-verifier.toml\n M .codex/config.toml\n M AGENTS.md\n M CONTRIBUTING.md\n?? workflow.md\n"},"started_at_ms":1788831914423,"completed_at_ms":1788831914423}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T01:45:14.561Z","ordinal":22239,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a07eb0-da41-7bb0-843b-749a1c1cfb07","call_id":"call_zfjfnN2yAnOvlUphYSB84hTu","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.4 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"59a878\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000007035,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":377,\"output\":\"# Task Group: Cakebrew macOS product engineering, icon packaging, and GitHub backlog\\n\\nscope: Cakebrew’s native macOS/Homebrew product maintenance: layered app icons, evidence publication, deep codebase/backlog audits, and filing verified feature issues.\\napplies_to: cwd=/Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew; reuse_rule=use Cakebrew paths, issue numbers, build command, and product constraints only in this checkout; reuse the verification and approval shields after checking the target repository and environment.\\n\\n## Task 1: Ship a layered macOS app icon and publish visual acceptance evidence\\n\\n### rollout_summary_files\\ndiff --git a/.codex/config.toml b/.codex/config.toml\\nindex 3d76ec0..b28a6e6 100644\\n--- a/.codex/config.toml\\n+++ b/.codex/config.toml\\n@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@\\n \\n+sandbox_mode = \\\"workspace-write\\\"\\n+approval_policy = \\\"never\\\"\\n [features]\\n hooks = true\\n## docs/agent-workflow...origin/main\\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-code-review/SKILL.md\\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-deliver/SKILL.md\\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-implement/SKILL.md\\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-plan/SKILL.md\\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-ui-review/SKILL.md\\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-verify/SKILL.md\\n M .agents/skills/cakebrew-workflow/SKILL.md\\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-code-reviewer.toml\\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-implementer.toml\\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-planner.toml\\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-ui-reviewer.toml\\n M .codex/agents/cakebrew-verifier.toml\\n M .codex/config.toml\\n M AGENTS.md\