{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T02:13:34.131Z","ordinal":22376,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a055ce-e4d9-77c1-ac18-0944a8c71200","turn_id":"01a07eca-579f-72b0-95b4-dd6f4e0bfedc","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-01c14e83-7a21-47ea-95ff-050fcb63e485","process_id":"78815","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","git push --no-verify -u origin docs/agent-workflow"],"cwd":"file:///Users/scottdensmore/Developer/scottdensmore/cakebrew","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git push --no-verify -u origin docs/agent-workflow"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"remote: \nremote: Create a pull request for 'docs/agent-workflow' on GitHub by visiting:        \nremote:      https://github.com/scottdensmore/Cakebrew/pull/new/docs/agent-workflow        \nremote: \nTo https://github.com/scottdensmore/Cakebrew.git\n * [new branch]      docs/agent-workflow -> docs/agent-workflow\nbranch 'docs/agent-workflow' set up to track 'origin/docs/agent-workflow'.\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"remote: \nremote: Create a pull request for 'docs/agent-workflow' on GitHub by visiting:        \nremote:      https://github.com/scottdensmore/Cakebrew/pull/new/docs/agent-workflow        \nremote: \nTo https://github.com/scottdensmore/Cakebrew.git\n * [new branch]      docs/agent-workflow -> docs/agent-workflow\nbranch 'docs/agent-workflow' set up to track 'origin/docs/agent-workflow'.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":712683290},"formatted_output":"remote: \nremote: Create a pull request for 'docs/agent-workflow' on GitHub by visiting:        \nremote:      https://github.com/scottdensmore/Cakebrew/pull/new/docs/agent-workflow        \nremote: \nTo https://github.com/scottdensmore/Cakebrew.git\n * [new branch]      docs/agent-workflow -> docs/agent-workflow\nbranch 'docs/agent-workflow' set up to track 'origin/docs/agent-workflow'.\n"},"started_at_ms":1788833612417,"completed_at_ms":1788833614130}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T02:13:43.919Z","ordinal":22377,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0229170f3e6ec7c3016a9f6f50150087d1ada73d96c5e58888","status":"completed","call_id":"call_nvX5mjZXBZv7lHCGzatlayim","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: /private/tmp/cakebrew-workflow-pr.Cx78mk/body.md\\n+## Summary\\n+\\n+- Consolidate the engineering lifecycle and Cakebrew-specific safeguards in AGENTS.md, reducing it from 475 to 302 lines.\\n+- Rewrite five custom subagents and seven skills as narrow role adapters with explicit ownership, evidence handoffs, independent gates and remediation routing.\\n+- Make CONTRIBUTING.md a short entry point rather than a duplicate workflow.\\n+\\n+The workflow keeps strict TDD, complete applicable verification, independent review, safe runtime concurrency and gated squash delivery. No application, test, build or CI files are changed. Unrelated local configuration is excluded.\\n+\\n+## Validation\\n+\\n+- YAML parsing and frontmatter validation for all seven skills and their existing interface metadata.\\n+- TOML parsing, required fields, sandbox preservation and skill routing for all five custom agents.\\n+- Policy section routing, pointer links, standalone instructions and whitespace checks.\\n+- Six independent workflow dry runs covering CI remediation, reviewer/implementer separation, shared UI runtime, false-green tests, delivery authorization and documentation-versus-CI validation.\\n+- Independent policy/config review approved the complete 14-file diff with no actionable findings.\\n+\\n+This instruction-only change is exempt from behavioral TDD. Native application builds and fresh-agent runtime execution were not performed or claimed. Skill Creator's Python validator could not run because PyYAML was unavailable; equivalent frontmatter checks used Ruby's YAML parser, and TOML used Python's standard parser.\\n+\\n+## Temporary Actions pause\\n+\\n+At the maintainer's explicit request, GitHub Actions was disabled repository-wide before this branch was pushed to conserve Actions minutes. CI has not run for this PR. This temporary repository setting does not modify workflow files or waive merge gates; leave this PR unmerged until Actions is re-enabled and required checks and assigned reviews pass.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:78815,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07eca-579f-72b0-95b4-dd6f4e0bfedc","create_time":1788833614.427305}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T02:13:44.026Z","ordinal":22378,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a055ce-e4d9-77c1-ac18-0944a8c71200","turn_id":"01a07eca-579f-72b0-95b4-dd6f4e0bfedc","session_id":"01a055ce-e4d9-77c1-ac18-0944a8c71200","root_turn_id":"01a07eca-579f-72b0-95b4-dd6f4e0bfedc","response_id":"resp_0229170f3e6ec7c3016a9f6f4e2dd087d1923097720dcfa10e","usage":{"input_tokens":106767,"cached_input_tokens":101760,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":448,"reasoning_output_tokens":0,"total_tokens":107215},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":309991,"cached_input_tokens":303616,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1048,"reasoning_output_tokens":88,"total_tokens":311039},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":301161628,"cached_input_tokens":297067136,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":567169,"reasoning_output_tokens":196889,"total_tokens":301728797}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T02:13:47.065Z","ordinal":22379,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a055ce-e4d9-77c1-ac18-0944a8c71200","turn_id":"01a07eca-579f-72b0-95b4-dd6f4e0bfedc","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-21dc62f9-7c78-4eff-ada6-8444c75bdb99","changes":{"/private/tmp/cakebrew-workflow-pr.Cx78mk/body.md":{"type":"add","content":"## Summary\n\n- Consolidate the engineering lifecycle and Cakebrew-specific safeguards in AGENTS.md, reducing it from 475 to 302 lines.\n- Rewrite five custom subagents and seven skills as narrow role adapters with explicit ownership, evidence handoffs, independent gates and remediation routing.\n- Make CONTRIBUTING.md a short entry point rather than a duplicate workflow.\n\nThe workflow keeps strict TDD, complete applicable verification, independent review, safe runtime concurrency and gated squash delivery. No application, test, build or CI files are changed. Unrelated local configuration is excluded.\n\n## Validation\n\n- YAML parsing and frontmatter validation for all seven skills and their existing interface metadata.\n- TOML parsing, required fields, sandbox preservation and skill routing for all five custom agents.\n- Policy section routing, pointer links, standalone instructions and whitespace checks.\n- Six independent workflow dry runs covering CI remediation, reviewer/implementer separation, shared UI runtime, false-green tests, delivery authorization and documentation-versus-CI validation.\n- Independent policy/config review approved the complete 14-file diff with no actionable findings.\n\nThis instruction-only change is exempt from behavioral TDD. Native application builds and fresh-agent runtime execution were not performed or claimed. Skill Creator's Python validator could not run because PyYAML was unavailable; equivalent frontmatter checks used Ruby's YAML parser, and TOML used Python's standard parser.\n\n## Temporary Actions pause\n\nAt the maintainer's explicit request, GitHub Actions was disabled repository-wide before this branch was pushed to conserve Actions minutes. CI has not run for this PR. This temporary repository setting does not modify workflow files or waive merge gates; leave this PR unmerged until Actions is re-enabled and required checks and assigned reviews pass.\n"}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA /private/tmp/cakebrew-workflow-pr.Cx78mk/body.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1788833623928,"completed_at_ms":1788833627065}}
