{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T02:16:36.628Z","ordinal":22420,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a055ce-e4d9-77c1-ac18-0944a8c71200","turn_id":"01a07ecd-5860-7493-96ec-54998be34ff0","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0229170f3e6ec7c3016a9f7002cf0487d1a6a2fdda443f7818","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’m using Skill Creator to keep the skill adapters aligned with AGENTS.md. I’ll distinguish a goal—which authorizes end-to-end delivery—from requests to only plan, review, or diagnose, and make clear that no second merge approval is needed once the gates pass.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788833794726,"completed_at_ms":1788833796628}}
