{"timestamp":"2026-09-08T02:18:25.733Z","ordinal":22481,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a07ecf-3c45-72e3-a658-a971345b8713","author":"/root/expert_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/expert_review\nPayload:\nReview gate approved; no actionable findings.\n\nAll five policy dry runs produce the intended behavior:\n\n- Assigned goal, gates green: squash merge without renewed permission.\n- “Leave PR open”: do not merge.\n- Independent slices: parallel worktrees, serialized shared UI/runtime.\n- Actions disabled: leave disabled; absent CI blocks merge.\n- Question or diagnosis: no implementation or delivery authority.\n\nReviewed delta: `e6c2596d5ddc476728e9469221b42ecba5efbe0eff14cf3fcec39d296de8e316`, against HEAD `d8f2d16468ebc44a9437fc7a839af3453dce3592`.\n\nSource released unchanged. These were static policy checks, not live workflow execution.\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07ecd-5860-7493-96ec-54998be34ff0","create_time":1788833905.733768}}}
